    /**
     * @description Controls access to job ID generation settings. Only the owner (the user whose ID is in the path) can read, create, update, or delete job ID generation settings.
     * @path artifacts/{appId}/users/{userId}/settings/jobIdGeneration
     * @allow (create) User 'A' creates a job ID generation document under artifacts/appid/users/A/settings/jobIdGeneration
     * @allow (get, update, delete) User 'A' reads/updates/deletes a job ID generation document under artifacts/appid/users/A/settings/jobIdGeneration
     * @deny (create) User 'B' attempts to create a job ID generation document under artifacts/appid/users/A/settings/jobIdGeneration
     * @deny (get, update, delete) User 'B' attempts to read/update/delete a job ID generation document under artifacts/appid/users/A/settings/jobIdGeneration
