    /**
     * @description Controls access to item code data. Only the owner (the user whose ID is in the path) can read, create, update, or delete item code documents.
     * @path artifacts/{appId}/users/{userId}/itemCodes/{itemCodeId}
     * @allow (create) User 'A' creates an item code document under artifacts/appid/users/A/itemCodes/item1
     * @allow (get, update, delete) User 'A' reads/updates/deletes an item code document under artifacts/appid/users/A/itemCodes/item1
     * @deny (create) User 'B' attempts to create an item code document under artifacts/appid/users/A/itemCodes/item1
     * @deny (get, update, delete) User 'B' attempts to read/update/delete an item code document under artifacts/appid/users/A/itemCodes/item1
