    /**
     * @description Controls access to schedule view settings. Only the owner (the user whose ID is in the path) can read, create, update, or delete schedule view settings.
     * @path artifacts/{appId}/users/{userId}/settings/scheduleView
     * @allow (create) User 'A' creates a schedule view document under artifacts/appid/users/A/settings/scheduleView
     * @allow (get, update, delete) User 'A' reads/updates/deletes a schedule view document under artifacts/appid/users/A/settings/scheduleView
